# Echoing Deeps "may have this land enter tapped as a copy of any land card in a graveyard, except it's a Cave in addition to
# its other types" (CR 614.1c, 707.2, 707.9b). Bot1's graveyard holds an Island (discarded to a Masked Meower) and the
# Meower, a nonland card that is no candidate; Bot2's holds a Swamp (the card its cleanup discarded at 8 cards), so there
# are two candidates, and the choice is not a target: Bot1 picks the opponent's Swamp. The copy is a tapped Swamp that is also
# a Cave, the Swamp card stays in its graveyard, and the copy has Swamp's mana ability, not Echoing Deeps' own.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Masked Meower
Island
Echoing Deeps
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x7
Swamp
Plains x7

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Masked Meower.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Masked Meower.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Discard 1 card)
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Echoing Deeps.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Swamp)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Tapped = true
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {B}
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Subtypes = Cave; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Types = Land
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Supertypes = Basic
Bot1.Graveyard = Masked Meower; Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Plains; Swamp
